e-pt cosmos-bg SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__dark cutoff_media SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__cutoff_media" data-cy="content-section"><section aria-label="Content Section" class="content-max-width"><div data-cy="content-section-container" class="content_section SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__content_section base SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__base top SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__top"><div class="content SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__content top SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__top"><div class=""><h2 class="title SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__title">Innovating the Future of Sales</h2><p class="h4 SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__subtitle subtitle content-simple">Give your GTM teams an unfair advantage. Now they can focus on the best accounts, spend more time selling, and win faster.</p></div><div class="buttons_section SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__buttons_section"><button data-automation-id="automation-popup-button" data-cy="button-popup-form" class="buttonPopupForm ButtonPopupForm-module-scss-module__WQMYXW__btn primary-btn button SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__button primary-btn-black ">Request demo</button></div></div><div data-cy="content-section-bottom" class="bottom_content SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__bottom_content"><div class="media_section SectionBase-module-scss-module__U3MFsW__media_section"><img alt="media-copilot-cutoff" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="2880" height="1920" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="ContentSectionMedia-module-scss-module__dNqHFW__image" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 1280px, 100vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/337OnLIqx7H1Gvsssef3Q8/9e357680273c57de8923efa300a81d74/media-copilot-cutoff.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div></section></div><section data-cy="cards-section" aria-label="Learn About Our Embedded Chat and Conversation Intelligence Capabilities" class="CardsSection wrapper-padding page-pt-pb section_wrapper CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__section_wrapper neutral-0-bg page-pt-pb CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__redesign"><div data-cy="content-wrapper" class="content-max-width CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__content_wrapper"><div data-cy="text-wrapper" class="CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__text_wrapper "><h2 class="h2" data-cy="heading">Learn About Our Embedded Chat and Conversation Intelligence Capabilities</h2><div class="CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__text neutral-800"><div class="html-content neutral-800 light" data-cy="html-content"><p>Generate and analyze customer interactions across essential communication channels, including your sales calls, email and phone outreach, and business website.</p></div></div></div><a class="CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__cta_btn primary-btn-black " data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="/free-trial?camp_id=7017y00001JIxRJAA1">Free Trial</a><div data-cy="cards-wrapper" class="CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__list grid-2-items-list CardsSection-module-scss-module__UuSpta__flex_start"><div data-cy="product_card" class="ProductCard ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__card ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__gradient_hover"><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark_clockwise"></div><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark_counter_clockwise"></div><span class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__line" data-cy="card_line"></span><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__top"><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__logo_container"><img alt="Acquisition logomark" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__media" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/5sRoW1ZjVBf4SBvcHwdt9E/4430a280212d6cd24276654cebaa55c2/Acquisition_logomark.svg"/></div><h2 data-cy="title" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__title h4 ">Chorus</h2></div><p data-cy="text" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__text neutral-800">Make every sales interaction count with conversation intelligence.</p><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__link_list" data-cy="link-list"><a class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__link_list_item text-link" data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="/products/chorus">Learn More</a></div></div><div data-cy="product_card" class="ProductCard ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__card ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__gradient_hover"><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark_clockwise"></div><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__spark_counter_clockwise"></div><span class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__line" data-cy="card_line"></span><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__top"><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__logo_container"><img alt="chat-logomark" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__media" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3A4GAyj1xd9KYezT4apDja/53266fedd79fc2e706d18c46654ae468/chat-logomark.svg"/></div><h2 data-cy="title" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__title h4 ">Chat</h2></div><p data-cy="text" class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__text neutral-800">Increase conversions with data-powered website chat.</p><div class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__link_list" data-cy="link-list"><a class="ProductCard-module-scss-module__fa8O_q__link_list_item text-link" data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="/products/chat">Learn More</a></div></div></div></div></section><section data-cy="testimonial-block-section" role="region" aria-label="Testimonial Block" class="wrapper-padding page-pt-pb TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__wrapper neutral-100-bg"><div data-cy="content" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__content content-max-width"><div class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__text_wrapper"><h2 class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__title h2" data-cy="heading">Trusted by Customers</h2><p data-cy="text" class="p neutral-800">Since ZoomInfo’s launch, customers have been over the moon with our products. Whether it’s exceeding sales goals, finding the best talent, or increasing ROI, ZoomInfo is the #1 choice for you.</p><a data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="https://www.zoominfo.com/free-trial" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__button primary-btn-black ">Free Trial</a></div><div data-cy="cards-list" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__cards_list"><div data-cy="left-column" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__column TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__left_column"><div aria-hidden="true" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card_top"></div><div data-cy="card-wrapper" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__card_wrapper"><div class="TestimonialCard TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial_block" data-cy="testimonial-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="23" height="16" viewBox="0 0 23 16" fill="none"><path d="M0 6C0 2.685 2.685 0 6 0H6.4C7.285 0 8 0.715 8 1.6C8 2.485 7.285 3.2 6.4 3.2H6C4.455 3.2 3.2 4.455 3.2 6V6.4H6.4C8.165 6.4 9.6 7.835 9.6 9.6V12.8C9.6 14.565 8.165 16 6.4 16H3.2C1.435 16 0 14.565 0 12.8V11.2V9.6V6ZM12.8 6C12.8 2.685 15.485 0 18.8 0H19.2C20.085 0 20.8 0.715 20.8 1.6C20.8 2.485 20.085 3.2 19.2 3.2H18.8C17.255 3.2 16 4.455 16 6V6.4H19.2C20.965 6.4 22.4 7.835 22.4 9.6V12.8C22.4 14.565 20.965 16 19.2 16H16C14.235 16 12.8 14.565 12.8 12.8V11.2V9.6V6Z" fill="#000514"></path></svg><div class="html-content TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial" data-cy="testimonial-content"><p>Thanks to ZoomInfo, we no longer have to question the source or reliability of the data in our systems. We’re now able to enrich and integrate data in any workflow, in real-time, at scale.</p></div><h2 class="name TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__name h5" data-cy="name">Ksenia Kouchnirenko</h2><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__job_title p xs" data-cy="job-title">VP of Business Systems, SurveyMonkey</p><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo_wrapper" data-cy="logo-wrapper"><img alt="Testimonial Logo" data-cy="testimonial-logo" loading="lazy" width="161" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3e14LY9wmfDWOT0kl1n2yX/230e57cf99f9b599fcbd892071d753d5/survey-monkey-logo.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3e14LY9wmfDWOT0kl1n2yX/230e57cf99f9b599fcbd892071d753d5/survey-monkey-logo.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3e14LY9wmfDWOT0kl1n2yX/230e57cf99f9b599fcbd892071d753d5/survey-monkey-logo.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div><div data-cy="card-wrapper" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__card_wrapper"><div class="TestimonialCard TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial_block" data-cy="testimonial-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="23" height="16" viewBox="0 0 23 16" fill="none"><path d="M0 6C0 2.685 2.685 0 6 0H6.4C7.285 0 8 0.715 8 1.6C8 2.485 7.285 3.2 6.4 3.2H6C4.455 3.2 3.2 4.455 3.2 6V6.4H6.4C8.165 6.4 9.6 7.835 9.6 9.6V12.8C9.6 14.565 8.165 16 6.4 16H3.2C1.435 16 0 14.565 0 12.8V11.2V9.6V6ZM12.8 6C12.8 2.685 15.485 0 18.8 0H19.2C20.085 0 20.8 0.715 20.8 1.6C20.8 2.485 20.085 3.2 19.2 3.2H18.8C17.255 3.2 16 4.455 16 6V6.4H19.2C20.965 6.4 22.4 7.835 22.4 9.6V12.8C22.4 14.565 20.965 16 19.2 16H16C14.235 16 12.8 14.565 12.8 12.8V11.2V9.6V6Z" fill="#000514"></path></svg><div class="html-content TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial" data-cy="testimonial-content"><p>All those times I was looking for numbers of important prospects and I didn&#x27;t find them. In despair, I&#x27;d look for them in ZoomInfo and find them. Like an early Xmas gift!</p></div><h2 class="name TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__name h5" data-cy="name">Heidi Lindstad</h2><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__job_title p xs" data-cy="job-title">Strategic Account Development, Snowlflake</p><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo_wrapper" data-cy="logo-wrapper"><img alt="Testimonial Logo" data-cy="testimonial-logo" loading="lazy" width="113" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/42gGu4kSdnBqQUgJgmeTgg/1c5463fafeca0f7a3fc474e6b45916f3/snowflake-logo__1_.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/42gGu4kSdnBqQUgJgmeTgg/1c5463fafeca0f7a3fc474e6b45916f3/snowflake-logo__1_.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/42gGu4kSdnBqQUgJgmeTgg/1c5463fafeca0f7a3fc474e6b45916f3/snowflake-logo__1_.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card_bottom"></div></div><div data-cy="right-column" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__column TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__right_column"><div aria-hidden="true" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card_top"></div><div data-cy="card-wrapper" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__card_wrapper"><div class="TestimonialCard TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial_block" data-cy="testimonial-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="23" height="16" viewBox="0 0 23 16" fill="none"><path d="M0 6C0 2.685 2.685 0 6 0H6.4C7.285 0 8 0.715 8 1.6C8 2.485 7.285 3.2 6.4 3.2H6C4.455 3.2 3.2 4.455 3.2 6V6.4H6.4C8.165 6.4 9.6 7.835 9.6 9.6V12.8C9.6 14.565 8.165 16 6.4 16H3.2C1.435 16 0 14.565 0 12.8V11.2V9.6V6ZM12.8 6C12.8 2.685 15.485 0 18.8 0H19.2C20.085 0 20.8 0.715 20.8 1.6C20.8 2.485 20.085 3.2 19.2 3.2H18.8C17.255 3.2 16 4.455 16 6V6.4H19.2C20.965 6.4 22.4 7.835 22.4 9.6V12.8C22.4 14.565 20.965 16 19.2 16H16C14.235 16 12.8 14.565 12.8 12.8V11.2V9.6V6Z" fill="#000514"></path></svg><div class="html-content TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial" data-cy="testimonial-content"><p>ZoomInfo has become an integral part of our business. Simply put, without it, we would have a huge gap in our sales enablement strategy that we would be scrambling to figure out how to fill.</p></div><h2 class="name TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__name h5" data-cy="name">Andy Ruffles</h2><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__job_title p xs" data-cy="job-title">Director of Sales Operations &amp; Strategy, Capital One</p><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo_wrapper" data-cy="logo-wrapper"><img alt="Testimonial Logo" data-cy="testimonial-logo" loading="lazy" width="67" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/4HNibQWNyjIwWqfIQmDNzE/31885c45f200eac58c32421c7a9fa4f4/capital-one-logo.png?w=96&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/4HNibQWNyjIwWqfIQmDNzE/31885c45f200eac58c32421c7a9fa4f4/capital-one-logo.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/4HNibQWNyjIwWqfIQmDNzE/31885c45f200eac58c32421c7a9fa4f4/capital-one-logo.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div><div data-cy="card-wrapper" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__card_wrapper"><div class="TestimonialCard TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial_block" data-cy="testimonial-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="23" height="16" viewBox="0 0 23 16" fill="none"><path d="M0 6C0 2.685 2.685 0 6 0H6.4C7.285 0 8 0.715 8 1.6C8 2.485 7.285 3.2 6.4 3.2H6C4.455 3.2 3.2 4.455 3.2 6V6.4H6.4C8.165 6.4 9.6 7.835 9.6 9.6V12.8C9.6 14.565 8.165 16 6.4 16H3.2C1.435 16 0 14.565 0 12.8V11.2V9.6V6ZM12.8 6C12.8 2.685 15.485 0 18.8 0H19.2C20.085 0 20.8 0.715 20.8 1.6C20.8 2.485 20.085 3.2 19.2 3.2H18.8C17.255 3.2 16 4.455 16 6V6.4H19.2C20.965 6.4 22.4 7.835 22.4 9.6V12.8C22.4 14.565 20.965 16 19.2 16H16C14.235 16 12.8 14.565 12.8 12.8V11.2V9.6V6Z" fill="#000514"></path></svg><div class="html-content TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__testimonial" data-cy="testimonial-content"><p>It&#x27;s saving me so much time finding new prospects with correct contact information. I love their social accounts are all on the same dashboard as wel!! It&#x27;s a one stop shop!!</p></div><h2 class="name TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__name h5" data-cy="name">Ashley Stoltz </h2><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__job_title p xs" data-cy="job-title">Supply Chain Solutions Consultant, Staples </p><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo_wrapper" data-cy="logo-wrapper"><img alt="Testimonial Logo" data-cy="testimonial-logo" loading="lazy" width="136" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__v65jSq__logo" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3j4StOUBoR1RKqlsDnBD3E/f8e3445b353d4e8d9d684aa199fe8313/staples-logo.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3j4StOUBoR1RKqlsDnBD3E/f8e3445b353d4e8d9d684aa199fe8313/staples-logo.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3j4StOUBoR1RKqlsDnBD3E/f8e3445b353d4e8d9d684aa199fe8313/staples-logo.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card TestimonialBlock-module-scss-module__58IFLa__fake_card_bottom"></div></div></div></div></section><section data-cy="trust-banner" class="TrustBanner wrapper-padding page-pt-pb neutral-0-bg"><div class="TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__container content-max-width TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__center"><div class="TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__content"><div class="TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__top_container"><h2 data-cy="title">Join the ABM platform trusted by over 250 million users</h2><div class="TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__flex_container"><a class=" secondary-btn-black " data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="/free-trial?camp_id=7017y00001JIxRJAA1">Free Trial</a></div></div><div data-cy="awards-wrapper" class="TrustBanner-module-scss-module__WAjdGW__awards"><img alt="Award image" data-cy="award-image" loading="lazy" width="500" height="576" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/5daduevzmWNLnpbqYwYIFx/0e9c03f707ab03604602e78b7cace6e6/Sales_Engagement.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/5daduevzmWNLnpbqYwYIFx/0e9c03f707ab03604602e78b7cace6e6/Sales_Engagement.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/5daduevzmWNLnpbqYwYIFx/0e9c03f707ab03604602e78b7cace6e6/Sales_Engagement.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="Award image" data-cy="award-image" loading="lazy" width="500" height="576" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/dXjwGpvFW4rbyQ4fBVMag/8f87a15707b90bc9bc21aaa2f710a2cd/Marketing_Account_Intelligence.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/dXjwGpvFW4rbyQ4fBVMag/8f87a15707b90bc9bc21aaa2f710a2cd/Marketing_Account_Intelligence.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/dXjwGpvFW4rbyQ4fBVMag/8f87a15707b90bc9bc21aaa2f710a2cd/Marketing_Account_Intelligence.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="Award image" data-cy="award-image" loading="lazy" width="500" height="576" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/79oIlhLrqfIBVsHf92Xvf9/4c5bb5461f868139089d04f58bf1bc59/Sales_Intelligence.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/79oIlhLrqfIBVsHf92Xvf9/4c5bb5461f868139089d04f58bf1bc59/Sales_Intelligence.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/79oIlhLrqfIBVsHf92Xvf9/4c5bb5461f868139089d04f58bf1bc59/Sales_Intelligence.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="Award image" data-cy="award-image" loading="lazy" width="500" height="576" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/70RfBegowVCyseHhXhiW5z/b04f7df3a16d76e22cd88ae76841a128/Email_Verification_Tracking_G2_Spring_-25_Leader_Badge-7.svg"/></div></div></div></section><section class="page-pt-pb wrapper-padding FaqBlock FaqBlock-module-scss-module__RfcM8W__neutral-0" data-cy="accordion-wrapper"><div class="content-max-width"><div class="FaqBlock-module-scss-module__RfcM8W__content" data-cy="body"><div class="FaqBlock-module-scss-module__RfcM8W__title_section"><h2 class="neutral-900 h2" data-cy="title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="FaqBlock-module-scss-module__RfcM8W__faqs_section" data-cy="faq-section"><div data-cy="accordion-wrapper" class="Accordion-module-scss-module__cnYzfW__accordion_wrapper"><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-0" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">Is ZoomInfo worth the price?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo has a proven track record of helping our customers reach their most important goal: profitable growth to the bottom line.</p><p>The B2B intelligence and automation available to ZoomInfo customers powers their go-to-market strategies and gives them the ability to deliver the right message, at the right time, to the perfect prospect.</p><p>Need examples? Check out our <a href="/about/case-studies/instapage">case study featuring Instapage</a>, a software company that increased year-over-year bookings by 192% after implementing ZoomInfo. Meanwhile, <a href="/about/case-studies/clum-creative">Clum Creative realized a 10x Return On Investment (ROI) with ZoomInfo</a>, after the video production company achieved a 104% increase in appointments set and a 60% increase in leads.</p><p>From enterprise organizations to rapidly growing start-ups and SMBs, over 30,000 customers rely on ZoomInfo to identify, connect with, and engage buyers within a Total Addressable Market (TAM). Just ask the Managing Director of Deal IQ, Aaron Kotick. After adopting ZoomInfo, his team <a href="/about/case-studies/deal-iq">realized an increase of over 1900% (!) in annual revenue</a>. “This is how a start-up hyper-accelerates,” Kotick explained. “We went from being a firm no one knew about to working with the largest companies in the world – all because we found them in ZoomInfo. We’ve seen a 1900% increase in annual revenue since implementing ZoomInfo.”</p><p>Success stories like the ones above are the reason <a href="https://www.zoominfo.com/newsroom/press-releases/zoominfo-earns-19-top-placements-g2-2020-fall-grid-reports">ZoomInfo earned top rankings in 19 categories in the Fall 2020 reports from G2</a>, a user reviews publication, even garnering a track record of superlatives issued to solutions that deliver ease-of-use, results, and ROI across all company segments.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-1" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">How much does ZoomInfo cost annually?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo pricing is based on the following criteria:</p><p>• Features and functionality<br/>• Number of licenses<br/>• Credit usage</p><p>The cost of ZoomInfo credits is based on the depth of information a customer requires. More robust credits cover advanced B2B intelligence, such as technographics, department budgets and org charts, and real-time alerts related to company events, like funding rounds and product launches. On the other hand, basic credits offer traditional demographic and firmographic details.</p><p>Add-on solutions to the ZoomInfo platform and integrations can also impact pricing and packaging. For example, our Streaming Intent solution is available as an add on for organizations that want real-time visibility into when companies are actively searching for the products and services they provide. Pricing for Streaming Intent, like our credit model, is based on expected usage, specifically around the volume of keywords and account universe a customer is interested in tracking.</p><p>Integrations can also impact price. Our platform seamlessly integrates with popular sales and marketing technologies, including out-of-the-box integrations with Customer Relationship Management (CRM), sales automation software, and marketing automation tools. These pre-packaged integrations typically have a base cost to use and install and require a minimum purchase of bulk credits for immediate use upon installation. If credit consumption is more than originally anticipated, customers can purchase additional credits.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-2" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">How do ZoomInfo packages work?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo takes a SaaS-based approach to pricing and packaging that provides us the flexibility to deliver our customers with the depth of B2B intelligence that matches their needs.</p><p>Packaging is based on the number of licenses our customers require and the desired level of access to data and features.. More advanced packages enable access well beyond basic contact and firmographic information; instead revealing insights like department sizes, org charts, technographics, and more.</p><p>Customers can also purchase out-of-the-box, plug-and-play integrations that sync ZoomInfo data directly into CRMs, marketing automation platforms, and sales automation tools.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-3" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">What are ZoomInfo credits?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo credits represent the consumption (export) of a professional or company profile from the ZoomInfo platform. This export can originate from the primary ZoomInfo platform, the ReachOut Chrome Extension, or any time an API call is made from any number of our integrations, including CRMs, marketing automation platforms, and sales automation tools.</p><p>Each export costs one credit, and credits can be added to any package as needs change. Overall ZoomInfo pricing is based on licenses and credit usage, as well as desired features.</p><p>Your ZoomInfo package will include a predetermined number of monthly credits based on your needs. While each unique package offers a tailored number of credits based on your intended use of ZoomInfo, all credits function the same way. Whenever your team exports company or contact information, a credit is consumed.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-4" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">What is the cost per contact on ZoomInfo?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>Credit usage occurs only when a user exports a contact or company profile from the platform to a CSV file or an application, most commonly an Excel file or internal CRM.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-5" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">Does ZoomInfo allow monthly payments?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo offers multiple payment options depending on your package, add-on features, and number of users. Our sales team will work with you on payment frequency and options.</p></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="0" class="focus AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__accordion_item   AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__neutral-100" data-cy="accordion-item"><div data-cy="accordion-title-container" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title_container pointer"><h4 id="Accordion-6" class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__title" data-cy="accordion-title">How do I pay ZoomInfo invoices?</h4><span class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__plus_minus_icon" data-cy="accordion-toggle-icon"></span></div><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content_wrapper" style="height:0px" data-cy="accordion-content-wrapper"><div class="AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__content" data-cy="accordion-content"><div class="html-content AccordionListItem-module-scss-module__Tz2s5a__text light" data-cy="answer"><p>ZoomInfo offers multiple ways for you to conveniently pay your invoice. Automatic payments including credit/debit card and ACH Debit or manual payments including wire/bank transfer, EFT, ACH, and check are all accepted.</p><p>For more information please visit our billing and payment support page at: <a href="https://www.zoominfo.com/about/payments">https://www.zoominfo.com/about/payments</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer data-cy="footer" role="contentinfo" class="Footer footer Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__footer wrapper-padding undefined"><div class="content-max-width" data-cy="footer-not-simple"><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__top_footer"><div data-cy="cta-banner" class="CtaBanner darkneutral-diagonal-bg CtaBanner-module-scss-module__j1G1ZG__wrappe