div></div><div><p class="eyebrow neutral-300 Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__label">Case Studies</p><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__case_studies"><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/3bYyWlfKlTzXOQxZIN2xtD/b811430d46d6f43f8fd78f7da2b7dd88/microsoft-logomark.svg"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">״Found a new CIO and launched a sales process, wouldn’t have done it without ZoomInfo.״</p><p class="p xs">Microsoft</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="128" height="128" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">&quot;Intent and signal data to reach the right companies at the right time.&quot;</p><p class="p xs">monday.com</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="128" height="128" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">&quot;One intent signal led to a meeting, a deal, and 25% of my yearly quota&quot;</p><p class="p xs"> Capital One</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2EccJK9s1DGpzhv12jnxkB/60641b8aac3a7db55c3aac6cfee5b598/mongoDB_logo_square.svg"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">&quot;Using ZoomInfo, we cut sales cycles by 30% and grew revenue 25%&quot;</p><p class="p xs">MongoDB</p></div></div></div></div></div><a class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__main_logo" data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="/"><img alt="zoominfo logo" data-automation-id="footer-zi-logo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/logos/acquisitions/zoominfo/zoominfo-red-logomark.svg"/></a></div><div data-cy="simple-footer" class="SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__wrapper SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__with_socials"><ul class="SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__legals"><li class="SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__legal_text"><span class="p xs">&copy; 2026 ZoomInfo Technologies LLC</span></li><li class="p xs SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__legal_text"><a data-cy="link" data-automation-id="link" href="https://www.zoominfo.com/legal/privacy-policy" class="SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__legal_link">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class="p xs SimpleFooter-module-scss-module__4kvGDW__legal_text"><a d